data: {"id": "8b5ec925fced45d6-thinking-layer-170", "run_id": "8b5ec925fced45d6", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我发现集群中有 1 个异常 Pod：\n- **Namespace**: `aiops-case-09`\n- **Name**: `workload-5f4fb9ff45-cfzz6`\n- **Status**: `Running`，但 `Ready` 为 `0/1`。\n\n根据 Runbook 定义，`Running` 但 `Ready` 为 `0/1` 的情况属于 **pod-notready-probe-failed**（NotReadyProbeFailed）异常类型。这通常是由于就绪探针（Readiness Probe）、启动探针（Startup Probe）或存活探针（Liveness Probe）配置错误或探测失败导致的。\n\n我将获取对应的诊断手册。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788463204352}

